"She was an Earth transmigrator, a hitwoman for an agency, sentenced to death row."
"A meteor killed her in a prison yard during Earth's meteor apocalypse."
"She woke alone in a skeleton's body in the Cursed City four or five months before she died."
"She had no Analyze and did not know it was a skill."
"Killing her gave the Hound an achievement for killing another transmigrator."
